  {
   "text": "Simpan dulu: tiga prompt buat ngedit reels pakai Claude Code.",
   "start": 0.073,
   "end": 3.92,
   "tags": "[playful] [excited]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ini alur yang aku pakai sendiri.",
   "start": 4.16,
   "end": 6.007,
   "tags": "[playful] [excited]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Prompt satu: siapin alat. Claude bikin folder, terus pasang lima alat.",
   "start": 6.08,
   "end": 10.727,
   "tags": "[playful] [excited]"
  },
  {
   "text": "YT-DLP ambil video contoh, Whisper ubah suara jadi teks, FFmpeg motong, HyperFrames sama Remotion bikin animasi.",
   "start": 10.8,
   "end": 18.88,
   "tags": "[playful] [excited]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Prompt dua: bikin selera. Kasih reels favoritmu, Claude catat polanya: tempo, caption, warna, pembuka.",
   "start": 19.1,
   "end": 26.48,
   "tags": "[playful] [excited]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ambil polanya, bukan isinya, dan jangan upload ulang video orang.",
   "start": 26.56,
   "end": 30.88,
   "tags": "[playful] [excited]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Prompt tiga: edit. Masukin video mentahmu, Claude buang jeda, pasang caption, sesuai selera tadi.",
   "start": 31.1,
   "end": 37.6,
   "tags": "[playful] [excited]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Kurang pas? Tinggal bilang, kayak ke editor: caption-nya naikin dikit.",
   "start": 37.735,
   "end": 41.84,
   "tags": "[playful] [excited]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Prompt satu dan dua cukup sekali. Video berikutnya, tinggal prompt tiga.",
   "start": 42.06,
   "end": 46.08,
   "tags": "[playful] [excited]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mau teks lengkapnya?",
   "start": 46.155,
   "end": 47.28,
   "tags": "[playful] [excited] [curious]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Komen prompt, aku kirim lewat DM.",
